### transaction management - Official Examples
### Execute requests in order: 10, 11, 12, then GETs

### 1. Create transaction 10
PUT http://localhost:8080/transactions/10
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000,
  "type": "cars"
}

### 2. Create transaction 11
PUT http://localhost:8080/transactions/11
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10000,
  "type": "shopping",
  "parent_id": 10
}

### 3. Create transaction 12
PUT http://localhost:8080/transactions/12
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000,
  "type": "shopping",
  "parent_id": 11
}

### 4. Find transactions by type
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/types/cars

### 5. Sum transaction 10
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/sum/10

### 6. Sum transaction 11
GET http://localhost:8080/transactions/sum/11
